  "question": {
    "text": "How many alcohols from the following set will yield geometric isomers on dehydration?<br />\rPropan-2-ol, 2-methylpropan-1-ol, pentan-2-ol, ethanol, propan-1-ol, 2-methylpropan-2-ol, butan-1-ol, butan-2-ol, hexan-3-ol",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "pentan-2-ol, butan-2-ol and hexan-3-ol yield geometrical isomers on dehydration.<br /><br>i. Pentan-2-ol: <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/0b0f43fe-bc80-42b9-b181-35fc82a43767.png\" style=\"width:5.06042in;height:1.12014in\" /><br /><br />ii. butan-2-ol <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>→</mo></math>&nbsp;<i>cis</i>-but-2-ene <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo></math>&nbsp;<i>trans-</i>but-2-ene<br /><br />iii. Hexan-3-ol:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ef217fae-ecdc-4f90-b3e4-2630445b670e.png\" style=\"width:5.06042in;height:0.9in\" />",
